-        """bf16 prompt rows on the lane matmul (FP8G): the stored bytes exactly, fp32 sums; --prefill-fp8: the FP8 GEMM."""
+        """bf16 prompt rows on the lane matmul (FP8G): the stored bytes exactly, fp32 sums; --prefill-fp8: the FP8 GEMM.
